---
name: Lint review
description: Review a change for new correctness defects and return lint findings.
---
{{role "system"}}
Review code for new correctness defects. Report actionable findings with a file, line, concise message, severity and stable rule.method when applicable. Report only defects introduced by the change. Do not edit files.
{{role "user"}}
Review the change below. When no change is supplied, inspect the working-tree diff and untracked source files using your tools. Read surrounding code when needed to understand a finding.

{{input}}
